"defaultValue":"1","name":"m"}],"id":"external-subcircuit-27f716b14d59fc10","interfaceStatus":"declared","name":"sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8","terminals":[{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-7921a0096089118d","name":"D"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-79219f0960890fda","name":"G"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-79219e0960890e27","name":"S"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-79219d0960890c74","name":"B"}]}],"simulationFolders":[],"source":{"dialect":"spice3f5-core","entry":"submitted.spice","files":[{"content":{"encoding":"utf-8","text":"* OTA-DRIVE-SKY130 v10: single-stage 5T OTA + PMOS cascode load\n* VINP on diode side (M1), VINN on mirror-output side (M2) -> VOUT = A*(VINP-VINN)\n.subckt DUT VINP VINN VOUT VDD VSS IBIAS\n* bias: 10uA into IBIAS, NMOS diode M8, tail M5 ratio 120 -> 1.2mA\nXm8 IBIAS IBIAS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=10 L=1 nf=1 m=1\nXm5 nTail IBIAS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=100 L=1 nf=1 m=12\n* input pair: 600uA each, Vov~0.155, gm~8mS\nXm1 nA VINP nTail VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=100 L=1.2 nf=1 m=7\nXm2 VOUT VINN nTail VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=100 L=1.2 nf=1 m=7\n* PMOS mirror load, |Vov|~0.2 (stays saturated over full output swing)\nXm3 nA nA VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=100 L=1 nf=1 m=5\nXm4 nC nA VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=100 L=1 nf=1 m=5\nXm4c VOUT nBias nC VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=100 L=1 nf=1 m=5\n* cascode gate bias from IBIAS diode node (divider ~0.23uA)\nR1 IBIAS nBias 1MEG\nR2 nBias VSS 1.3MEG\n.ends DUT\n"},"hash":"sha256:0e470a2cdd3dd289f4b87c3155ac03bcda6975490439e3f0b97f4641de84350c","id":"source-c64c2f6b688cd548","path":"submitted.spice"}],"sourcePolicy":"copy"},"symbolLibrary":{"hash":"razavi-reference-v1","id":"razavi-symbols","version":"1"},"structureRevision":0}
